          {
            "title": "Intro",
            "id": 74179,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kita tahu cara mengulang kode menggunakan perulangan while. Seperti pada program ini yang mengulang pernyataan untuk menampilkan Bendera Amerika.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter1 = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter1 &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter1++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter2 = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter2 &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter2++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Intro 2",
            "id": 74163,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dengan menggunakan <strong>for loops</strong>, kita bisa menulis ulang program yang sama agar lebih mudah dipahami oleh programmer lain.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For keyword",
            "id": 74164,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk membuat perulangan for, kita mulai dengan kata kunci <code>for</code>, tanda kurung <code>( )</code>, dan kurung kurawal <code>{ }</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" () {}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>()</code>, lalu <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Untuk membuat perulangan for, kita mulai dengan kata kunci <code>for</code>, tanda kurung <code>( )</code>, dan kurung kurawal <code>{ }</code>.</p><p>Lengkapi struktur for loop yang kosong.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" () {}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, dan terakhir <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "For Loops",
            "id": 74165,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop for memungkinkan kita membuat variabel penghitung di dalam tanda kurung, seperti <code>let counter = 1;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"21\" /></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>let counter = 1;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "i counter",
            "id": 74178,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nama yang umum untuk variabel penghitung adalah huruf <code>i</code>, yang merupakan singkatan dari index. Kita akan menggunakannya untuk mempelajari perulangan for.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"counter\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Nama yang umum untuk variabel penghitung adalah huruf <code>i</code>, yang merupakan singkatan dari index. Kita akan menggunakannya untuk mempelajari perulangan for.</p><p>Mulai penghitung loop dari <code>1</code> menggunakan nama index yang umum.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"12\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"const\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"counter\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>let</code>, diikuti oleh <code>i</code>, dan terakhir <code>=</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "For Loops",
            "id": 74166,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah titik koma, kita menempatkan kondisi seperti <code>i &lt; 5</code> dan menambahkan titik koma lainnya <code>;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i = 10\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i &lt; 5</code>, diikuti oleh <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Setelah titik koma pertama, letakkan kondisi lalu titik koma lainnya <code>;</code>.</p><p>Lanjutkan selama <code>i</code> kurang dari <code>5</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"16\" endIndex=\"17\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"22\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"10\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>, diikuti oleh <code>&lt;</code>, <code>5</code>, dan terakhir <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "For Loops",
            "id": 74167,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Terakhir, kita menaikkan variabel penghitung dengan <code>i++</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"26\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>i++</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "All in one",
            "id": 74224,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kode for loop lebih mudah dibaca karena informasi tentang berapa kali loop diulang berada di dalam tanda kurung.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kode for loop lebih mudah dibaca karena informasi tentang berapa kali loop diulang berada di dalam tanda kurung.</p><p>Tampilkan <code>1</code> hingga <code>4</code>. Bandingkan <code>i</code> dengan nilai pertama yang tidak boleh ditampilkan.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i--\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"4\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>(</code>, diikuti oleh <code>i</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>5</code>, <code>i++</code>, dan terakhir <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: For keyword",
            "id": 74241,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jenis loop apa yang dimiliki ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop for</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop while</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Loop for.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop menginisialisasi <code>i</code>, mengujinya, dan memperbaruinya dalam satu header. Jenis loop apa yang ditampilkan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"4\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Loop for</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop while</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Pernyataan if</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih Loop for.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Counter variable",
            "id": 74242,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ke mana perginya variabel penghitung dari perulangan for?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Di dalam tanda kurung <code>( )</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Di dalam kurung kurawal <code>{ }</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Di dalam tanda kurung <code>( )</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kamu ingin for loop mulai menghitung dari <code>1</code>. Kode mana yang menetapkan nilai awal itu di dalam tanda kurungnya?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>let i = 1</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>i &lt; 5</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>i++</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>let i = 1</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: i counter",
            "id": 74243,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel mana yang menjadi variabel penghitung dari perulangan for?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Rock you!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Variabel mana yang dimulai dari <code>0</code>, diuji terhadap <code>2</code>, dan berubah setelah setiap pengulangan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"2\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;We will&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Rock you!&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"We will\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Rock you!\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>counter</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada variabel penghitung.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Condition",
            "id": 74244,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Kondisi apa yang dimiliki loop for?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Everybody want to&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;be like me&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Everybody want to\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i &lt; 3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let i = 0</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i &lt; 3</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagian mana dari header loop yang menentukan apakah baris <code>\"be like me\"</code> lainnya dicetak?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Everybody want to&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;be like me&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"Everybody want to\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"be like me\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i &lt; 3</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>let i = 0</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>i++</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i &lt; 3</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: Incrementing",
            "id": 74245,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Apa yang salah dengan kode ini?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" i++\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i++</code> berada di luar tanda kurung <code>( )</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tidak ada yang salah dengan kodenya</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>i++</code> berada di luar tanda kurung <code>( )</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Loop berfungsi, tetapi kode kontrolnya tidak berada di satu tempat. Bagian mana yang harus dipindahkan ke dalam tanda kurung?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" i++\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>i++</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>console.log(i)</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Kurung kurawal pembuka <code>{</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>i++</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question: All in one",
            "id": 74246,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mengapa kode for loop lebih mudah dibaca daripada kode while loop?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Karena jumlah pengulangan for loop berada di satu tempat</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Karena perulangan for mencegah kita menulis perulangan tak terbatas</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Karena jumlah pengulangan for loop berada di satu tempat.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Saat membandingkan kedua loop, mengapa for loop lebih mudah dipindai sebelum dijalankan?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" counter = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"while\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (counter &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\") {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;**********---------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" counter++;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"4\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;-------------------&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"**********---------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"-------------------\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Awal, kondisi, dan pembaruannya muncul bersama dalam header.</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Loop tidak pernah dapat berulang selamanya.</item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Loop tidak memerlukan nilai penghitung.</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Awal, kondisi, dan pembaruannya muncul bersama dalam header.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: For keyword",
            "id": 74249,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Menyusun struktur for loop.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" () {}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"4\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"6\" /><option startIndex=\"7\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"8\" endIndex=\"9\" /></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>(</code>, lalu <code>)</code>, <code>{</code>, <code>}</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ulangi blok kode kosong tiga kali. Mulai <code>i</code> dari <code>0</code> dan gunakan perbandingan lebih kecil dari.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"(\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"=\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"&lt;\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"3\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\";\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"i\" /><text value=\"+\" /><text value=\"+\" /><text value=\")\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"3\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"14\" /><option startIndex=\"18\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"21\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"26\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"while\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"2\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"i--\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>for</code>, diikuti oleh <code>0</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, <code>3</code>, dan terakhir <code>i++</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Counter variable",
            "id": 74250,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam tanda kurung, buat variabel counter dengan <code>let i = 5;</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"10\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"15\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"5\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"6\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"7\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"8\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"9\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>let i = 5;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: i counter",
            "id": 74251,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam perulangan for, gunakan variabel penghitung <code>i</code> untuk menampilkan <code>\"Round \" + i</code> di konsol.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Round &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Round 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Round 2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Round 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Round 4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Round \"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>+</code>, dan terakhir <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tampilkan <code>Round </code> diikuti nomor ronde saat ini, dari <code>1</code> hingga <code>4</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"1\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"5\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Round &quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\" + i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"51\" /><option startIndex=\"52\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"55\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"-\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;i&quot;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"counter\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Round 1\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Round 2\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Round 3\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"Round 4\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>\"Round \"</code>, diikuti oleh <code>+</code>, dan terakhir <code>i</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Example: Condition",
            "id": 74252,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Di dalam tanda kurung, buat variabel penghitung dan kondisi.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"15\" endIndex=\"16\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option startIndex=\"23\" endIndex=\"24\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"50\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"51\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"52\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"53\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"54\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>let i = 50</code>, diikuti oleh <code>;</code>, lalu <code>i &lt; 55</code>, <code>;</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Siapkan loop untuk menampilkan setiap angka dari <code>50</code> hingga <code>54</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\" name=\"script.js\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"for\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" (\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" i = \" /><text value=\"50\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i &lt; \" /><text value=\"55\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"; i++) {\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(i);\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"5\" endIndex=\"8\" /><option startIndex=\"9\" endIndex=\"10\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"15\" /><option startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"19\" endIndex=\"20\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"23\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&lt;=\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"56\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"51\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"50\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"51\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"52\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"53\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"54\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu memilih <code>let</code>, diikuti oleh <code>i</code>, <code>50</code>, <code>i</code>, <code>&lt;</code>, dan terakhir <code>55</code>.</p></body></html>",
